---
// Caps content at the design's 1600px frame width and centers it, so
// ultrawide monitors don't pin the page to the far-left edge. Owns the
// horizontal edge inset too — the panel, hero and footer all defer to this
// one padding value instead of each adding their own, which is what kept
// their left edges a few pixels apart instead of flush.
---

<div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-page px-s5">
  <slot />
</div>
